    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Hexwarp Thrallband",
    "summary": "The Flow of Magic of your army covers:\n\n- Your deployment zone, always.\n- No Man's Land for a phase, when that phase starts with you controlling half or more of its objective markers.\n- The opponent's deployment zone for a phase, on the same condition.\n\nRe-roll **Wound rolls** of 1 for each **[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)** Attack a **THOUSAND SONS** model of yours makes; a model wholly within your Flow of Magic gets +1 to its Wound rolls instead.",
